    {
      "id": "445FFC76F180A6BE",
      "title": "&f&lOne class, one subclass&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
        "",
        "&fThe supplied tree restricts you to one class root and one subclass root. Each class has three subclass options with positive bonuses and meaningful tradeoffs. Compare those tradeoffs before investing.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fChoose the playstyle you enjoy during ordinary fights, not only a boss damage screenshot.",
        "",
        "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
        "",
        "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
      ],
      "dependencies": [
