    {
      "id": "2464CB320F85B809",
      "title": "&f&lBuild the class foundation&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
        "",
        "&fEach class has five mandatory inner branches with four nodes each: twenty foundation nodes. Follow the displayed prerequisite route through class mastery and the specialization gate to reach a subclass.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fThe twenty foundation nodes are not the entire cost of reaching a subclass; approach, root and gate nodes also matter.",
        "",
        "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
        "",
        "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
      ],
      "dependencies": [
