    {
      "id": "07FBD158781540A6",
      "title": "&f&lThree paths inside a subclass&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
        "",
        "&fEach subclass has three independent fourteen-node paths. Follow each branch’s own learned-skill requirements. The optional synergy nodes are side destinations; they do not skip another path’s requirements.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fFocus on a useful path first. The all-path apex rewards completing the foundation of all three paths.",
        "",
        "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
        "",
        "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
      ],
      "dependencies": [
