      "id": "022E0143EE58CD1A",
      "title": "&f&lMatch equipment to your tree&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
        "",
        "&fA tree bonus only helps when its conditions and relevant attribute apply. Compare weapon type, school, casting cost, armor and movement rather than choosing equipment solely for its rarity.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fUse the item tooltip and the actual skill node as the final description of their effects.",
        "",
        "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
        "",
        "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
